Description: Noxis Linux – OPSEC layer
 Firewall (inbound closed, outbound only via the Mullvad tunnel), Mullvad
 always-on + killswitch, Quad9 over DNS-over-TLS, USB lock while the
 screen is locked, keyboard without prediction and RAM-only data,
 volatile logs, kernel hardening, random MAC addresses.
